out the  business and you'll find out one is this  what you want do you want to be an  entrepreneur do you like this person's  lifestyle do you want that for you and  two is this business for you you thought  you're gonna be a graphic designer but  now you got involved in the business I  thought nah this isn't for me I want  something else go find another job again  small company related to something that  you're interested in that way when  you're ready to go start your business  you have all the information that you  need you've been watching the videos and  you get lots of experience from that new  knowledge you've been reading up on  famous entrepreneurs and their stories  you get inspired by them you know what  next steps to take you see what they had  to do to grow their business and then  you have some practical hands-on  experience working for a company  who's doing what you want to do you're  building up your your contacts your  network your knowledge base so when  you're ready to launch your business you  can hit the ground running it'll  dramatically increase your chance of  success it'll dramatically increase your  probability of picking a business that  you love doing where you can have an  impact in the world where you can build  something that people will rally around  increase the chances you're making a lot  of money and increase a chance you're  going to be doing something that you're  really happy about get going believe for  those of you watching you like the video  please give it a thumbs up below it  makes me do more for you and I want to  hear what you have to think please leave  a comment under this video and makes my  morning every day when I load up the  comments and see what's coming in really  you guys are awesome for me so you give  me my motivational boost every day so  please leave a comment below if you  liked it and if you have a question for  your business leave it there i'll make a  video apply for you guys thank you and  I'll see 